OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, denies 22 sexual offences
OL,4,
OL,5,FA 15-year-old boy has pleaded not
OL,6,Fguilty to 22 sexual offences, including
OL,7,Frape, against eight girls.
OL,9,FThe teenager, who cannot be named
OL,10,Fbecause of his age, was charged with
OL,11,Fone count of rape, rape of a child
OL,12,Funder 13 and assault by penetration at
OL,13,FNorthampton Crown Court on Friday.
OL,15,FThe offences are alleged to have taken
OL,16,Fplace between 2023 and 2025, with the
OL,17,Fvictims aged between 10 and 15.
OL,19,FHis trial is due to begin at the same
OL,20,Fcourt on 25 October 2027 and is
OL,21,Fexpected to last three to four weeks.
